{"id":"n27216-1-9","stage":1,"title":"공휴일 · 公休日","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n27216-1-9-1","ko":"이 날은 공휴일인가요?","zh":"这一天是公共假日吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"날은","meaning":"日子","explanation":"날：日子；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"날","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62254","senseId":"4","lemma":"날","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"공휴일인가요?","meaning":"公休日，公共休假日，法定假日","explanation":"공휴일：公休日，公共休假日，法定假日；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ가요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"공휴일","audio":"/audio/0d2052ad3918cbc1d931.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27216","senseId":"1","lemma":"공휴일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"818c8a303c20bac0","term":"날","zh":"日子","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3","entryId":"62254","definition":"以某种理由指定下来的一天。","pronunciation":["날"]},{"id":"0d2052ad3918cbc1","term":"공휴일","zh":"公休日，公共休假日，法定假日","audio":"/audio/0d2052ad3918cbc1d931.mp3","entryId":"27216","definition":"像国庆节或节日等由国家制定的休息日。","pronunciation":["공휴일"]}],"audio":"/audio/68c6089bfa36ddbb6169.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n27216-1-9-2","ko":"네. 그래서 그날은 회사에 출근하지 않아도 돼요.","zh":"是，所以那天不用去公司上班。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래서","meaning":"因此，所以","explanation":"그래서：因此，所以","readings":[{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61169","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그날은","meaning":"那天，那日","explanation":"그날：那天，那日；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"그날","audio":"/audio/f243f3eadf4a87a81a35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36674","senseId":"1","lemma":"그날","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"회사에","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"출근하지","meaning":"上班","explanation":"출근하다：上班；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"출근하다","audio":"/audio/c9a21c441e737abe8903.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62368","senseId":"1","lemma":"출근하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않아도","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71581","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돼요.","meaning":"可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）","explanation":"되다：可以、得到允许（-아/어도 되다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，是的，哎","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于回应长辈的呼叫。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"8df56b9bfbdae2fd","term":"그래서","zh":"因此，所以","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3","entryId":"61169","definition":"用于表示前面内容是后面内容的原因、依据或条件等。","pronunciation":["그래서"]},{"id":"f243f3eadf4a87a8","term":"그날","zh":"那天，那日","audio":"/audio/f243f3eadf4a87a81a35.mp3","entryId":"36674","definition":"前面说过的那一天。","pronunciation":["그날"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":